    <string name="foyer_presence_section_tooltip_title">Presence &amp; absence</string>
    <string name="foyer_presence_section_tooltip_description">When no household member has been detected on the home WiFi for more than 24h, tasks in \"at home\" categories stop aging (paused). They resume normally on return.\n\nAutomatic detection relies on the WiFi network(s) declared below. It\'s optional: with no WiFi configured, all tasks stay visible permanently.</string>
